#: ../../openmvcam/shields/poe-shield.rst:2
#: ../../openmvcam/shields/poe-shield.rst:6
msgid "PoE Shield"
msgstr "Shield PoE"

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/poe-shield.rst:4
msgid ""
"The PoE Shield adds 802.3af Power-over-Ethernet to OpenMV Cams that have an "
"on-board Ethernet PHY — one cable to a PoE switch carries both power and the"
" network link."
msgstr ""
"Le shield PoE ajoute l'alimentation par Ethernet (Power-over-Ethernet) "
"802.3af aux OpenMV Cam dotées d'un PHY Ethernet intégré — un seul câble vers"
" un commutateur PoE achemine à la fois l'alimentation et la liaison réseau."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/poe-shield.rst:11
msgid ""
"For full datasheet, photos, and ordering see the `PoE Shield product page "
"<https://openmv.io/products/poe-shield>`_."
msgstr ""
"Pour la fiche technique complète, les photos et les commandes, consultez la "
"`page produit du shield PoE <https://openmv.io/products/poe-shield>`_."

#: ../../openmvcam/shields/poe-shield.rst:16
msgid "Supported only on the OpenMV Cam RT1062 and N6."
msgstr "Pris en charge uniquement sur les OpenMV Cam RT1062 et N6."

